'''Tatsugiri''' (Japanese: '''シャリタツ''' ''Syaritatsu'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

