==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features a {{form|Tatsugiri|Curly Form}} {{p|Tatsugiri}} in both of its illustrations.
*This card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Tatsugiri|62}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Tatsugiri|141}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*'''Rally Back''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Shining Legends|Shaymin|7}} from the {{TCG|Shining Legends}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

